OL,3,GNEWSABeing on the Sewing Bee 'a dream
OL,4,Acome true'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCompeting on the BBC One programme, The
OL,7,FGreat British Sewing Bee is "a dream
OL,8,Fcome true", one of the contestants has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe show sees amateur sewers compete to
OL,12,Fimpress judges Patrick Grant and Esme
OL,13,FYoung, hoping to be crowned Britain's
OL,14,Fmost sensational seamster.
OL,16,FAdele Burn, from Blackburn in
OL,17,FLancashire, said the experience "was
OL,18,Fjust absolutely fantastic".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
