OL,3,GNEWSABeing on the Sewing Bee 'a dream
OL,4,Acome true'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said a particular "life highlight"
OL,7,Fwas winning garment of the week on week
OL,8,Ftwo, which focused on print and colour,
OL,9,Fwhere her made-to-measure cross-back
OL,10,Ftop and culottes set "was just
OL,11,Fperfection" according to Grant.
